Example of using Fenix for online process recovery.

Input files
in.file     : Checkpoints to file, uses Fenix only for online recovery
in.universe : As in.file, but runs with 2 partitions and 1 partition of spares

Relevant Variables
nspare      : How many spare ranks to allocate (for in.file)
x, y, z     : Input region size in each dimension (x20)
